h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col
 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><h3><strong>The grumpiest uncle in showbiz is back. Join Tez Ilyas for his brand-new tour!</strong></h3><p>Fresh from travelling the world (and smashing it as a top husband and bunny-stepdad), the UK’s leading de-influencer returns with a brand-new stand-up show. Expect fresh jokes, furious rants, and ridiculous stories — all delivered with Tez’s trademark smart, silly, and subversive humour.</p><p>Star of: <em>Man Like Mobeen</em> (BBC Three), <em>Live at the Apollo </em>(BBC Two), <em>Fighting Talk</em> (BBC Radio 5 Live) and Sunday Times bestselling author of <em>The Secret Diary of a British Muslim Aged 13 ¾.</em><br /></p><p>Book early. You’ll hate yourself if you miss it</p><p>Presented by UTC Live</p></div></section></div><aside class="o-sidebar-grid__sidebar " id="page-sidebar"><div class="h-only-desktop"><div class="c-meta o-block"><dl class="c-meta__list"><div class="c-meta__item"><dt class="c-meta__key">Price</dt><dd class="c-meta__value o-text"><p>£20 - £35 (plus £1.20 per ticket online, £1.40 per ticket over the phone)</p></dd></div><event-manager
